## Summary
Before assignment, estimate task complexity:
- Analyze task description, affected files, similar past tasks
- Assign complexity score (S/M/L/XL)
- Supervisor can balance load: don't give 4 XL tasks simultaneously
- Track actual vs estimated for calibration

## Technical Approach

### Files to Create
- `internal/complexity/complexity.go` - Complexity types and estimation
- `internal/complexity/calibration.go` - Actual vs estimated tracking

### Files to Modify
- `internal/kanban/issue.go` - Add `Complexity` and `ActualComplexity` fields
- `cmd/foundry/kanban.go` - Display complexity in task list
- `cmd/foundry/supervisor.go` - Track concurrent complexity load
- `.forge/prompts/groomer.md` - Add complexity estimation instructions

