## Summary
Monitor system resources and adjust worker behavior:
- If CPU/memory high, pause worker assignment
- If API rate limits hit, back off automatically
- If too many failures, slow down and alert

## Technical Approach

### Files to Create
- `internal/health/health.go` - Health check types and thresholds
- `internal/health/monitor.go` - Resource monitoring functions
- `internal/health/throttle.go` - Throttling logic

### Files to Modify
- `cmd/foundry/supervisor.go` - Add health check to cycle
- `cmd/foundry/supervisor.go` - Add throttling flags

